{
  "__inputs": [],
  "__requires": [
    {
      "type": "grafana",
      "id": "grafana",
      "name": "Grafana",
      "version": "10.2.0"
    },
    {
      "type": "datasource",
      "id": "prometheus",
      "name": "Prometheus",
      "version": "1.0.0"
    }
  ],
  "uid": "efe-msw-safety",
  "title": "EFE Meta-Swarm \u2014 Safety Violations",
  "description": "Box / Poly / Hull safety geometry violations. Used for compliance audits + dev investigation.",
  "tags": [
    "efe",
    "meta-swarm",
    "pr19",
    "safety",
    "compliance"
  ],
  "editable": false,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "timezone": "utc",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 2,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-24h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "prometheus_ds",
        "type": "datasource",
        "label": "Prometheus",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {
          "text": "Prometheus",
          "value": "Prometheus"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "cluster",
        "type": "query",
        "label": "Cluster",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${prometheus_ds}"
        },
        "query": "label_values(efe_meta_swarm_safety_violations_total, cluster)",
        "refresh": 1,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": false,
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "env",
        "type": "query",
        "label": "Environment",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${prometheus_ds}"
        },
        "query": "label_values(efe_meta_swarm_safety_violations_total{cluster=~\"$cluster\"}, env)",
        "refresh": 1,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": false,
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "kind",
        "type": "custom",
        "label": "Safety kind",
        "query": "box,poly,hull",
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true
      },
      {
        "name": "participant_id",
        "type": "query",
        "label": "Participant",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${prometheus_ds}"
        },
        "query": "label_values(efe_meta_swarm_safety_violations_total{cluster=~\"$cluster\",env=~\"$env\"}, participant_id)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "runbook_base",
        "type": "constant",
        "query": "https://efe.example.com/runbook/meta-swarm",
        "current": {
          "text": "https://efe.example.com/runbook/meta-swarm",
          "value": "https://efe.example.com/runbook/meta-swarm"
        },
        "hide": 2,
        "skipUrlSync": true,
        "label": "runbook base URL"
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Total violations (24h)",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${prometheus_ds}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(increase(efe_meta_swarm_safety_violations_total{cluster=~\"$cluster\",env=~\"$env\",kind=~\"$kind\",participant_id=~\"$participant_id\"}[24h]))",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 10
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 100
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Violation rate (5m, /s)",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${prometheus_ds}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(efe_meta_swarm_safety_violations_total{cluster=~\"$cluster\",env=~\"$env\"}[5m]))",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Violations by kind (rate, stacked)",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${prometheus_ds}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (kind) (rate(efe_meta_swarm_safety_violations_total{cluster=~\"$cluster\",env=~\"$env\",kind=~\"$kind\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{kind}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 30,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal",
              "group": "A"
            },
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "sum"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "Top 10 participants by violations (1h)",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${prometheus_ds}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "topk(10, sum by (participant_id) (increase(efe_meta_swarm_safety_violations_total{cluster=~\"$cluster\",env=~\"$env\",kind=~\"$kind\"}[1h])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{participant_id}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 5
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 50
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "displayMode": "lcd",
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "showUnfilled": true,
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "heatmap",
      "title": "Violation heatmap (participant \u00d7 kind)",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 12,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "description": "topk(200,...) caps cardinality per AD16.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${prometheus_ds}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "topk(200, sum by (participant_id, kind) (rate(efe_meta_swarm_safety_violations_total{cluster=~\"$cluster\",env=~\"$env\",kind=~\"$kind\"}[5m])))",
          "format": "heatmap",
          "legendFormat": "{{participant_id}} / {{kind}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "calculate": false,
        "cellGap": 1,
        "color": {
          "mode": "scheme",
          "scheme": "Spectral"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Cross-reference : iterate failures with failure_reason=safety_violation",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 12,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${prometheus_ds}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(efe_meta_swarm_safety_violations_total{cluster=~\"$cluster\",env=~\"$env\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "safety violation rate",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(efe_meta_swarm_iterate_total{failure_reason=\"safety_violation\",cluster=~\"$cluster\",env=~\"$env\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "iterate failures (reason=safety_violation)",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 5,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Safety doctrine references",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 20,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Safety kinds (closed taxonomy)** :\n- `box` \u2014 axis-aligned bounding box\n- `poly` \u2014 convex polytope\n- `hull` \u2014 convex hull (Phase-3 default)\n\n**Linked alert** : [A7 SafetyViolationSpike](${runbook_base}/RB_PR19_MSW7.md) \u2014 fires > 0.1/s sustained 5m.\n\n**Compliance** : safety violation events flow to the compliance audit Loki sink via the Alertmanager `continue: true` route (PR #19 AD31).\n"
      }
    }
  ]
}